{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-b0b01f7de675", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:33:14.103Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:33:23.275Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14273, "tokens_out": 338, "latency": 0.2527, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0031 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:2ab4876985dfcf259f73cfceadb937b742e770d7b293f2bb32e7864637a57e31", "response_text": "## Status Summary: TM-2026-0031\n\n**Claim overview**\n- Policyholder: J. Okonkwo\n- Policy: TM-HH-441907 (Household, escape of water)\n- Incident: 3 May 2026 | Notified: 5 May 2026\n- **Status: Open**\n\n**Progress to date**\n- Adjuster report received 14 May 2026 — cause confirmed as failed push fit connector from 2023 bathroom refit\n- Drying and reinstatement completed by Redwell Restoration\n- Policyholder accepted replacement kitchen units (original range discontinued)\n- Redwell invoice £18,144.48 authorised and paid (19 June 2026)\n- Subrogation against refit contractor considered but not pursued (firm dissolved 2024)\n\n**Financial position**\n- Reserve: £21,700\n- Paid to date: £18,144\n- Outstanding reserve: £3,556\n\n**Next steps**\n\n1. **Obtain final account/completion notice** from Redwell Restoration to confirm all works finished and invoiced\n2. **Settle outstanding reserve** once completion confirmed — review for any final remedial items or reinstatement shortfalls\n3. **Close claim** and update recovery ledger\n\nThe claim appears substantially complete on the reinstatement side. You'll want confirmation from the restoration contractor that all works are finished before finalising the reserve position.", "response_hash": "sha256:91aca956e2323b193d1ca6bece03dd3947fcd00fd5c55b038b7fd7979c506a13", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
